Package: winslot
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libvirt-daemon-system, libvirt-clients, qemu-system-x86, qemu-utils,
 ovmf, swtpm, swtpm-tools, zfsutils-linux, xorriso, 7zip, dnsmasq-base
Recommends: packer, frr
Description: licensed Windows VM slots on libvirt
 Builds golden Windows images with Packer and runs Windows VMs as "license
 slots": libvirt domains whose hardware identity (SMBIOS UUID, MAC, disk
 serial/WWN, machine type) never changes, so a VM can be recreated on a fresh
 disk and reactivate by itself. VM SSH host keys are learned over the serial
 port at first boot and signed by a host CA; VMs are published for Prometheus
 DNS service discovery.
